  "selectedReplayRule": "Current required authorization precedes replay; exact authorized retries resolve the original accepted result using the selected logical identity and immutable actor/intent/source binding. Fresh mutable feasibility, clock selection and body preparation cannot replace that original result. Expected revision is concurrency precondition, not a new identity.",
  "commandNote": "Planned 2026-10-29 from the aggregate methods Record, Correct, Respond and LinkFinding; no handlers or routes exist yet (October 23 audit lists them under issue 301).",
  "productRules": [
    {
      "id": "D04-04",
      "doc": "m0-d04-readiness-material.md",
      "rule": "Consultant-authored imported content keeps imported_from provenance (source file, row, stated author text) and is never attributed to a platform actor who did not act; the accepting member is the actor of the acceptance decision only."
    },
    {
      "id": "D27-03",
      "doc": "m0-d27-attest-scope.md",
      "rule": "Auditor-identified exceptions are recorded as AuditTestException preserving the auditor's wording as received."
    }
  ],
  "decides": "Each imported row keeps its original source identifier as provenance separate from the observation id; a missing source identifier is recorded as source_identifier_absent and never synthesized from row order. Consultant-authored content keeps imported_from provenance (source file, row, stated author text) and is never attributed to a platform actor, with the accepting member recorded as actor of the acceptance only. Auditor-identified exceptions keep the auditor's wording exactly as received.",
